    <string name="feature_settings_impl_about_content_license_summary">CC BY-SA</string>
    <string name="feature_settings_impl_about_content_license_body">Article text shown in this app comes from Wikipedia / MediaWiki and is generally available under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike (CC BY-SA) license. Please follow the license terms for attribution and check each page for its specific license notice.\n\nUsing this app does not change the license of Wikipedia content. “Wikipedia” and “Wikimedia” are trademarks of their respective owners.</string>
